# Mobile + deploy pipeline

This repo mirrors Neve Selvagem (`snow`) and Amarelinho for phone editing:

- Cloud Agent work must land on a **`cursor/*`** branch with a PR to **`develop`**.
- **Auto-merge Cursor PRs** merges after CI and dispatches **Deploy HostGator** + **Deploy GitHub Pages**.
- When the user asks to ship / deploy / “manda pro ar”, finish with PR (cloud) or commit+push to `develop` (local), bump `SDF_BUILD`, and confirm Actions.
- See `AGENTS.md` and `docs/MOBILE-AUTO-PROD.md`.
